    narr:narration """The architectural strategy for analytics infrastructure has coalesced around the adoption of [Zypherion](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_1). This shift is driven by a specific performance mandate, with claims that the new system delivers [15x faster columnar query execution](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_2) compared to the existing environment. The transition is framed as a [formal commitment](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_3) to modernize the analytics pipeline, with the migration scheduled to commence in Q3 2026. This decision is presented as a [consolidated technical record](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_4), emphasizing both the tooling choice and the expected operational gains. The broader trajectory reflects a [deliberate migration toward specialized columnar infrastructure](narr:Narrative_AnalyticsDatabaseToolingChoice) to address current performance bottlenecks.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1LifecycleStepA_1> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1LifecycleStepA_2> ;
